   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Outcome</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">A market-responsive and social and gender-inclusive TVET system established.</narrative>
   </description>
   <indicator measure="2">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indicator 2</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">By 2018, employer satisfaction with TVET graduates increases to 70% (2012 baseline: 45%) 
Progress/Status: Tracer  study has been completed and the final tracer study report has been submitted to ADB. 

The report shows the employer satisfaction as follows:
- Extremely Satisfy: 40%
- Satisfy: 50%

Similarly, project evaluation report has been submitted to the project by consulting firm. The project is reviewing the report to submit  the final report to ADB. 
Data Source: CTEVT Survey 
Actual value:</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline value="45" year="2012"></baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2018-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2018-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="70"></target>
    </period>
   </indicator>
   <indicator measure="2">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indicator 1</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">By 2018, at least 75% of graduates are employed 6 months after training (of graduates, 40% are women and 30% from excluded groups) 
(2012 baseline: 63% female and 64% male) 
Progress/Status: The Third- Party Monitoring (TPM) completed employment verification of all trainees under the project. The final employment rate verified by TPM is 77.96%.

Out of 47,500 contracted seats, 47,284 (99.5%) participants were enrolled. Out of that, 19,352 (41%) were female, and 34,047 (72%) were from disadvantaged groups. 
Data Source: Tracer Studies 
Actual value:</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline value="63" year="2012"></baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2018-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2018-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="75"></target>
    </period>
   </indicator>
  </result>
